## Slide 6

Mesh Network

Zero Configuration
New Data Collectors connect and begin communicating automatically

Data Relay
Data is relayed to the Coordinator through the closest device

Self Mending
Self-Optimization to find the quickest path back to the Coordinator

Add and Expand
Add new Data Collectors to the Edge of the Network as Needed

## Slide 7

TrakSYS Connectivity

Integrated
Natively linked to TrakSYS without communication servers.

Efficient
Messages are sent to the TrakSYS server on data change and heartbeat.

Firewall Friendly
Port 80 is the only required firewall configuration. This is typically already allowed.

Secure
Communication flows only from the Coordinator to the TrakSYS server.

